{"title":"Career Roadmap · Dairy Technologist","role":"Dairy Technologist","summary":"A Dairy Technologist applies food science, microbiology, chemistry, engineering and process-control principles to milk and dairy-product processing. The role covers milk collection, pasteurisation, homogenisation, fermentation, processing, quality assurance, packaging, cold-chain management and product development.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Dairy Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to target"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Dairy chemistry, microbiology, food processing, engineering fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Milk processing, quality testing, HACCP, laboratory skills"}],[{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"Industrial internship + dairy plant exposure + process optimisation"}],[{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Graduate Dairy Technologist / Production / QA role"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Independent process and quality responsibilities"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Senior Technologist / Process Specialist / QA Specialist"}],[{"text":"2037–2040"},{"text":"Production, R&D, Quality or Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Plant leadership, technical consulting, specialised R&D or entrepreneurship"}]]}]},{"heading":"Step 1 — What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Engineering + science foundation"},{"text":"Chemistry, biology, mathematics, basic engineering, communication"},{"text":"Lab records + mini project"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Dairy science foundation"},{"text":"Dairy microbiology, dairy chemistry, milk processing"},{"text":"Quality-analysis project"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Industrial dairy technology"},{"text":"Pasteurisation, homogenisation, fermentation, packaging, QA"},{"text":"Plant internship + process project"}],[{"text":"4th Year"},{"text":"Professional specialisation"},{"text":"HACCP, GMP, process control, product development, data analysis"},{"text":"Major project + internship"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Build the scientific foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus strongly on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering physics"},{"text":"Engineering chemistry"},{"text":"Biology/biochemistry"},{"text":"Basic electrical and mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Communication skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Food/dairy fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Milk composition"},{"text":"Proteins, fats, carbohydrates and minerals"},{"text":"Milk physicochemical properties"},{"text":"Basic food microbiology"},{"text":"Food safety fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Python is not mandatory for entry-level dairy jobs, but it becomes useful for quality data, process optimisation and production analytics."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mini-project"},{"type":"h","text":"“Analysis of Milk Quality Parameters”"},{"type":"p","text":"Study variables such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pH"},{"text":"Acidity"},{"text":"Fat"},{"text":"SNF"},{"text":"Protein"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Microbial quality"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Become strong in dairy science","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should move from general engineering into specialised dairy technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Important subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dairy chemistry"},{"text":"Dairy microbiology"},{