,{"type":"p","text":"A strong 4th-year Dairy Technology graduate should have:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech Dairy Technology","1 serious dairy-plant internship","HACCP/GMP knowledge","strong dairy-processing fundamentals","laboratory experience","one industry-relevant project","Excel/Power BI","basic statistics","strong understanding of food safety","documented process-improvement work."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"That combination keeps the student eligible for production, QA/QC, food safety, R&D and process-technology roles, rather than being restricted to a single dairy job."}]}]}